{"4306760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evercrown", "steam_appid": 4306760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/5104eca8c30e43a86251278bc3658e20.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1560 height=1743 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/79b836ddca1262f8bfcf0a60a5e726fa.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the wheel and discover your abilities with every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-roll, lock in the best results, and build your perfect turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to turn a random draw into a winning strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/f04548475ad26ed1a9e215080ddaad4c.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>Use your abilities, bonuses, and passives to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn depends on your build and the choices you’ve made before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you progress, the more powerful your options become.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/f4581a9e0b860d66f1f6ab24ebaba1e4.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>After each battle, choose an upgrade from several options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add bonuses to your skills, unlock passives, or recruit new heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice directly influences your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/29ee570655b450586dcff9a3d712e24b.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>Create synergies, stack bonuses, and skyrocket your damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from dealing a few hits to unleashing devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further your build progresses, the more powerful your attacks become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/5af81bd36cfdc8bcab23c91eddc219ac.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades, adapt your build, and push your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is different thanks to the bonuses and possible combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run ever goes as planned.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/79b836ddca1262f8bfcf0a60a5e726fa.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the wheel and discover your abilities with every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-roll, lock in the best results, and build your perfect turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s up to you to turn a random draw into a winning strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/f04548475ad26ed1a9e215080ddaad4c.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>Use your abilities, bonuses, and passives to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn depends on your build and the choices you’ve made before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you progress, the more powerful your options become.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/f4581a9e0b860d66f1f6ab24ebaba1e4.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>After each battle, choose an upgrade from several options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add bonuses to your skills, unlock passives, or recruit new heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice directly influences your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/29ee570655b450586dcff9a3d712e24b.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span>Create synergies, stack bonuses, and skyrocket your damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from dealing a few hits to unleashing devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further your build progresses, the more powerful your attacks become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/extras/5af81bd36cfdc8bcab23c91eddc219ac.avif?t=1783338925\" width=1537 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your upgrades, adapt your build, and push your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is different thanks to the bonuses and possible combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No run ever goes as planned.</p>", "short_description": "A turn-based tactical roguelike where your heroes’ actions are decided by a slot machine. Spin, lock, and reroll abilities, read enemy intentions, build powerful synergies, and push your run into explosive late-game scaling.", "supported_languages": "French, English, Spanish - Spain, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4306760/2c010514c4f9594dd628d91893e25fd16992b1e7/header.jpg?t=1783338925", "capsule_image": "https://shared.ak